{"ref":"BDB, אַדֶּ֫רֶת","hw":"אַדֶּ֫רֶת","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַדֶּ֫רֶת</span></big>  <strong>n.f. glory, cloak</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:24\" href=\"/Joshua.7.24\">Jos 7:24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אַדָּ֑רֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.8\">Ez 17:8</a>; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:25\" href=\"/Genesis.25.25\">Gn 25:25</a> + 4times; <span dir=\"rtl\">אַדַּרְתּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:13\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.13\">1 K 19:13</a> + 3 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">אַדַּרתָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:3\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.3\">Zc 11:3</a>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>glory, magnificence</em>, of vine <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.8\">Ez 17:8</a> (so Thes MV, but < adj. f. from <span dir=\"rtl\">אַדִּיר</span> q.v.), of shepherds <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:3\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.3\">Zc 11:3</a> (or <em>sub</em> <strong>2</strong>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>mantle, cloak</em> (wide garment) of hair <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׂעָר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:25\" href=\"/Genesis.25.25\">Gn 25:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 13:4\" href=\"/Zechariah.13.4\">Zc 13:4</a> (as proph. mantle, so perhaps <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:3\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.3\">11:3</a> of shepherds = false proph.) cf. of Elijah <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:13\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.13\">1 K 19:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:19\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.19\">19</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 2:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.2.8\">2 K 2:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 2:13\" href=\"/II_Kings.2.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 2:14\" href=\"/II_Kings.2.14\">14</a>; but <span dir=\"rtl\">אַדֶּרֶת שִׁנְעָר טוֹבָה</span> (fine mantle of Shinar = Babylonian mantle—doubtless costly) <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:21\" href=\"/Joshua.7.21\">Jos 7:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:24\" href=\"/Joshua.7.24\">24</a> (J) & (late) <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> alone <a data-ref=\"Jonah 3:6\" href=\"/Jonah.3.6\">Jon 3:6</a>.","next":"BDB, אֲדָר","prev":"BDB, אַדִּיר"}